## Migration rule

Do not alter the reference geometry or behavior to fit the existing legacy Multitrack implementation.

Instead:
1. preserve the reference contract,
2. adapt its authorities to the R3 stack,
3. split presentation into isolated feature modules,
4. validate each module against the reference,
5. switch the live route only after parity gates pass.
